      <activity id="b895a656-bf17-5be6-af06-dd1b23157f5d" activityNameId="a7fdc95c-5122-5142-915e-325da4951b1e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, PV, at 450 kWp flat-roof, single-Si</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, PV, at 450 kWp flat-roof, single-Si
Electricity from a photovoltaic installation with a capacity of 450 kWp and a life time of 30 years installed in 2006 in DE and operated by the Edisun Power GmbH. Module efficiency updated based on Fraunhofer ISE Photovoltaics Report from 14 November 2019. Specific annual yield adjusted based on Breyer &amp; Schmid (2010) (calculated with population-density weighted solar irradiation of fixed tilted PV systems). UUID: 5b6674f5-0de2-3b4e-9ccd-9478ac117655
Infrastructure for 450kWp PV plant, water use for cleaning, amount of solar energy transformed to electricity and waste heat emission due to losses of electricity in the system. Annual output, Roof-Top: 922 kWh/kWp.
Location: Use in DE.
Technology: Electricity production with grid-connected photovoltaic power plants.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistical data for DE.
Extrapolations: Water demand estimated at 20 L per m2 PV module over life time of the system.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5b6674f5-0de2-3b4e-9ccd-9478ac117655.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
